## Expected Behavior

```markdown
## Meeting notice and location: [N5024](https://isocpp.org/files/papers/N5024.pdf)
```

And for the table section, either preserve the table:
```markdown
| Document | Editor's report | Prospective WD |
|---|---|---|
| C++ 26 Working Draft | [N5032](https://wg21.link/N5032) | [N5033](https://wg21.link/N5033) |
```

Or at minimum preserve the links even if the table structure is lost:
```markdown
Editor's reports: C++ 26 Working Draft [N5032](https://wg21.link/N5032) [N5033](https://wg21.link/N5033)
```

