## Scope

- This is a **body converter** issue, NOT a metadata/frontmatter issue
- The metadata extraction (reply-to, document, date, title, audience) is working correctly with 0 FAIL across 270 papers
- Fix should be in the HTML conversion pipeline only
- Must not break existing working link conversions (8 out of 12 links in n5034 already work)
- Test with n5034.html as primary test case, but also check other HTML papers for similar patterns

